<title>USA: American River ups dividend.</title>
<headline>American River ups dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>American River Holdings said Thursday it increased its semi-annual dividend to $0.145 a share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on July 23 to shareholders of record on July 15.</p>
<p>The company's last semi-annual dividend was $0.14 a share.</p>
